        "tab_materials": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Design & make",
            "icon": "leather",
            "content": "<p>An original EvlveX design, model CB-01. Smooth upper with textured overlays at the toe, eyestay and collar, a padded collar and a stitched white cupsole. The EvlveX monogram sits on the outer side: embroidered in white on The Silent Grind, embossed on A Fresh Start.</p><p>Designed and made in India. Every pair is inspected before it is packed.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_fit": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Size & fit",
            "icon": "ruler",
            "content": "<p>Unisex, UK/India sizing. Our shoes run true to standard Indian/UK sizing: select your normal UK size. Women: choose the UK size that is 2 below your Women's US size (Women's US 8 = UK 6).</p><p>Free size exchange within 7 days of delivery. <a href=\"/pages/size-guide\" title=\"Size guide\">Open the size guide</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_care": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Care",
            "icon": "washing",
            "content": "<p>Smooth panels: wipe with a soft, dry cloth. Textured overlays: brush gently in one direction and protect before first wear. Cupsole: a damp cloth and mild soap. <a href=\"/pages/care\" title=\"Care guide\">Full care guide</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_shipping": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Shipping & returns",
            "icon": "truck",
            "content": "<p>Free shipping across India on every order. Prepaid orders only (UPI, cards, net banking, wallets); dispatch in 1–2 working days, delivery usually in 3–7 working days.</p><p>Return or exchange the size within 7 days of delivery, unworn, in its numbered box with the dust bag and certificate tag. Free pickup. <a href=\"/policies/refund-policy\">Returns policy</a> · <a href=\"/policies/shipping-policy\">Shipping policy</a></p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "tab_certificate": {
          "type": "collapsible_tab",
          "settings": {
            "heading": "Your pair's certificate",
            "icon": "check_mark",
            "content": "<p>Every pair is numbered and carries a QR tag under the tongue. When your order ships, its certificate is registered in your name: scan the tag to read the story of your pair. <a href=\"/pages/authenticity\" title=\"Authenticity\">How it works</a>.</p>",
            "page": ""
          }
        },
        "assurance": {
          "type": "evlvex_assurance",
